## Core Feature:
1. diff view of code changes so dev can accept or reject
2. lightweight single binary 
3. Write a file & write pertial 
4. read file 
5. Can use bash commands in unix
6. before changing the file store the state to accept and reject changes

pending
7. chat summerization approches

---
## Tech Stack -
1. Go backend
2. Bubble tea TUI
3. Sqlite for Database


